Add AddressSanitizer (ASan) build target.

CMake build configuration that enables ASan for detecting memory errors.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] cmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=ASan (or similar) enables ASan
- [ ] -fsanitize=address -fno-omit-frame-pointer added to compile and link flags
- [ ] All test targets build with ASan configuration
- [ ] ASan output readable (symbolized with -fno-omit-frame-pointer)
- [ ] Documented in build instructions

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build with ASan, run all tests, verify ASan report clean
- [ ] Intentionally introduce use-after-free, verify ASan detects it
- [ ] Verify no false positives
